<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish April trade surplus 572.9 million punts-CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish April trade surplus 572.9 million punts-CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's seasonally adjusted trade surplus widened to 572.9 million punts in April from 547.0 million in March, Central Statistics Office (CSO) figures showed on Thursday.  </p>
<p>			   Imports	Exports	     Gap</p>
<p> April 1996	    1,813.4	2,386.4	     572.9</p>
<p> March 1996	    1,863.2	2,410.2	     547.0</p>
<p> April 1995	    1,611.9	2,143.8	     531.9</p>
<p>		   (Figures in millions of punts)</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom 353 1 660 3377</p>
</text>
